:: Deadwood Reblooms Company Ascension Widgets [widget]

<<widget 'deadwood-ascension-header'>>
  <<set _ascension to maplebirch.get('Finance').company.ascension>>
  <<set _ascension_state to _ascension.state>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-ascension-return'>>
  <br><<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the lobby', '返回大厅'] 'Office Lobby'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-ascension-preparation-link'>>
  <<deadwood-ascension-header>>
  <<if _ascension.canPrepare>>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink ['Ask to share in the ceremony (0:10)', '要求一同参与仪式 (0:10)'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Company Ascension Preparation'>>
      <<if maplebirch.get('Finance').company.ascension.prepare()>><<pass 10>><</if>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-ascension-proposal-link'>>
  <<deadwood-ascension-header>>
  <<if _ascension.canPropose>>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink ['Raise your terms before going upstairs (0:05)', '上楼前提出你的条件 (0:05)'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Company Ascension Proposal'>>
      <<if maplebirch.get('Finance').company.ascension.canPropose>><<pass 5>><</if>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-ascension-terms-room'>>
  <<deadwood-avery-ceremony-header>><<deadwood-ascension-header>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The lift opens onto the upper room. Red moonlight fills it through the skylight. The elk-masked guests kneel around a table.
      Remy stands beside it, holding the knife aloft.
      <br><br>
      "You who would complete our triumvirate," <<nnpc_he 'Remy'>> begins.
      <br><br>
      Avery stops before stepping forward. "There's another matter."
      Harper takes your elbow. "We spoke downstairs. The fox still brings the stones. The recipient's part may be shared."
      The chanting has not begun. Remy lowers the knife a little.
      <br><br>
      "May?"
      <br>
      "We can make the request," Harper says. "We can't answer it."
      <br><br>
      Remy looks you over. "And what do you bring?"
      <br>
      "You know what I bring," you say. "My part in the company. The work I've put behind it. I won't spend all of that to remain outside the door."
      <br><br>
      "A place at the table isn't a pension," Remy says. "There'll be work. Things you won't put in the company minutes. You won't always like who benefits."
      Harper slips the purple box from <<nnpc_his 'Harper'>> coat. "You still lie beneath the skylight. They'll hold you in place. The knife still rests above your heart."
      <br><br>
      "Will it hurt?"
      <br>
      "Yes," Harper says. "You may carry it afterwards. Joining us won't spare you that."
      <br><br>
      Avery watches you. "And it doesn't take my place away."
      <br>
      "Or mine," Remy says. <<nnpc_He 'Remy'>> turns the knife in <<nnpc_his 'Remy'>> hand. "If you're received, we'll make room for a fourth. If you aren't, no vote can force it."
      <br><br>
      Harper opens the box. The stones glisten in the moonlight. <<nnpc_He 'Harper'>> holds it where you can reach it.
      "Your answer. Before we begin."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      电梯门在顶层打开。红色月光从天窗倾入室内，戴麋鹿面具的宾客跪在桌子四周。
      雷米站在桌旁，高举着刀。
      <br><br>
      “你，将使我们的三人执政团——”<<nnpc_he 'Remy'>>开口道。
      <br><br>
      艾弗里没有马上走过去。“还有一件事。”
      哈珀扶住你的胳膊。“楼下已经谈过。狐狸仍然献石，受封的部分可以试着由两人承担。”
      吟唱尚未开始。雷米把刀稍稍放低。
      <br><br>
      “试着？”
      <br>
      “我们可以请求。”哈珀说。“答复不由我们给。”
      <br><br>
      雷米打量着你。“那你带来了什么？”
      <br>
      “你知道我带来了什么。”你说。“公司里属于我的部分。为它做的那些事。我不会付出这些，最后还站在门外。”
      <br><br>
      “有个席位，不是让你来养老。”雷米说。“会有活干。有些事，不会写进公司会议记录。得利的人，也未必是你喜欢的。”
      哈珀从外套里取出紫色盒子。“你仍要躺在天窗下。他们会把你固定住，刀仍然要抵在你的心脏上方。”
      <br><br>
      “会痛吗？”
      <br>
      “会。”哈珀说。“也可能一直留在你身上。加入我们，不会免掉这部分。”
      <br><br>
      艾弗里盯着你。“也不许拿走我的位置。”
      <br>
      “还有我的。”雷米把刀在手中转了一圈。“如果它接纳了你，我们就为第四人腾个位置。如果没有，多少票也没用。”
      <br><br>
      哈珀打开盒子。许愿石在月光中闪烁，<<nnpc_he 'Harper'>>把盒子递到你够得着的地方。
      “说出你的回答。开始之前。”
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<templeicon>><<lanLink ['Accept the terms', '接受这些条件'] 'Skyscraper Party 14'>>
    <<run maplebirch.get('Finance').company.ascension.accept()>>
  <</lanLink>><br>
  <<refuseicon>><<lanLink ['Withdraw your request and keep your original role', '撤回要求，按原来的安排参与'] 'Skyscraper Party 13'>>
    <<run maplebirch.get('Finance').company.ascension.withdraw()>>
  <</lanLink>><br>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-ascension-dream'>>
  <<deadwood-ascension-header>>
  <<if _ascension_state.accepted and $fake_artefact isnot 'Avery' and !$replayScene and !$statFreeze>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        As the garden fades, something black alights on the wall. A bird. Its claws close around the stone, and its head turns towards you.
        You try to see its face. For a moment, you're looking back at yourself from above.
        <br><br>
        The roofs stretch away below. Little shapes move between them. Your chest tightens. Somewhere beneath your feet, something hungry shifts.
        You fall towards the skylight. The bird is gone before you can decide if it was there at all.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        花园消退时，有团黑影落在围墙上。一只鸟。它的爪子扣住石沿，转头望向你。
        你想看清它的脸。一瞬间，你正从高处回望自己。
        <br><br>
        屋顶在下方铺开，小小的身影穿行其间。你的胸口一紧。脚下某处，有个饥饿的东西动了一下。
        你朝天窗坠去。还没来得及确定那只鸟是否真的存在，它便消失了。
    <</language>><br><br>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-ascension-awakening'>>
  <<deadwood-ascension-header>>
  <<if _ascension.canAwaken>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        The wound pulls at your heart. Then the pull stops, leaving a steady pressure beneath it. You gasp. Your limbs have gone cold.
        <br><br>
        A black shape spreads across the ceiling, where no shadow should fall. You blink, and find only moonlight.
        The ache is still there. You can breathe around it now.
        <br><br>
        Harper turns towards you. Remy follows <<nnpc_his 'Harper'>> gaze.
        You grip the edge of the table and sit up. The stone beneath your hand feels warm.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        那道伤口牵扯着你的心脏。接着，拉扯停了，留下胸腔深处持续的压迫。你猛地吸气，四肢冷得发僵。
        <br><br>
        天花板上掠开一团黑影，那里本不该有影子。你眨眨眼，只剩月光。
        伤口仍然疼。现在，你能顺着它呼吸了。
        <br><br>
        哈珀转过头，雷米也跟着看向你。
        你抓住桌沿，坐了起来。手底下的石头是暖的。
    <</language>><br><br>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-ascension-recognition'>>
  <<deadwood-ascension-header>>
  <<if _ascension.active>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Remy stops beside you as the congratulations begin. Harper is still watching the place above your heart.
        <br><br>
        "The Crimson Hound. The Silver Fox. The High Elk," Remy says. <<nnpc_He 'Remy'>> looks from Avery to Harper, then to you.
        "And the Black Raven. Auriga has received you."
        <br><br>
        Harper bows <<nnpc_his 'Harper'>> head. "We'll need to speak about what you felt. Soon."
        Avery lifts <<nnpc_his 'Avery'>> mask. "Keep the name upstairs. I have enough questions to answer tomorrow."
        <br><br>
        Remy holds out a hand. "We'll see what you make of it."
        You take it. The grip is firm, and slow to release. The nearest guests lower their heads.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        宾客上前道贺时，雷米在你身旁停下。哈珀仍盯着你心口的位置。
        <br><br>
        “猩红猎犬。银狐狸。高麋鹿。”雷米看过艾弗里，又看过哈珀，最后望向你。
        “还有黑渡鸦。奥利加接纳了你。”
        <br><br>
        哈珀低下头。“你刚才的感觉，得跟我说说。尽快。”
        艾弗里掀起面具。“这名字留在楼上。明天要回答的问题，已经够多了。”
        <br><br>
        雷米伸出手。“看看你能做成什么。”
        你握住它。那只手握得很紧，迟迟没有松开。站在近处的宾客都垂下了头。
    <</language>><br><br>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-ascension-audience-link'>>
  <<deadwood-ascension-header>>
  <<if _ascension.canAudience>>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink ['Discuss your place among them', '谈谈你在他们之中的位置'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Company Ascension Audience'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-ascension-jordan-link'>>
  <<deadwood-ascension-header>>
  <<if _ascension.canTellJordan>>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink ['Tell Jordan about the tower (0:10)', '向约旦讲述塔楼里的事 (0:10)'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Company Ascension Jordan'>>
      <<if maplebirch.get('Finance').company.ascension.tellJordan()>><<pass 10>><</if>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-ascension-gwylan'>>
  <<deadwood-ascension-header>>
  <<if _ascension_state.ascended and $auriga_scar and $demon lt 6 and $gwylan>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "The wound doesn't drag me back into it now," you say. "They called me the Black Raven."
        <br><br>
        Gwylan studies your face. "And now you're looking down on the hunt?"
        <<nnpc_He 'Gwylan'>> glances towards the sea. "Take care when you land. They have snares for birds, too."
        <br><br>
        <<nnpc_His 'Gwylan'>> hand settles on your shoulder. "You can still come here. Whatever they've called you."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        “那道伤口，没再把我往里面拖了。”你说。“他们叫我黑渡鸦。”
        <br><br>
        格威岚端详着你的脸。“现在，你在天上俯看他们狩猎了？”
        <<nnpc_He 'Gwylan'>>望了一眼海面。“落地时小心些。他们也有捕鸟的网。”
        <br><br>
        <<nnpc_His 'Gwylan'>>的手搭上你的肩。“你还是可以来这里。无论他们管你叫什么。”
    <</language>><br><br>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-ascension-journal'>>
  <<deadwood-ascension-header>>
  <<if _ascension_state.ascended>>
    <h2 class='purple'>
      <<if _ascension_state.recognized>>
        <<lanSwitch 'Black Raven' '黑渡鸦'>>
      <<else>>
        <<lanSwitch 'Ascended' '飞升'>>
      <</if>>
    </h2>
    <ul class='journal'>
      <li>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            You shared in Avery's ascension.
            <<if _ascension_state.recognized>>
              Remy and Harper acknowledged a fourth place among them, and called you the Black Raven.
            <<else>>
              You feel something steady beneath the new wound. The room has fallen silent.
            <</if>>
            The wound above your heart remains, but its lingering ache no longer keeps adding to your trauma as time passes.
            Tension and fatigue gradually ease. Other suffering can still leave its mark on you.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            你与艾弗里一同完成升华。
            <<if _ascension_state.recognized>>
              雷米与哈珀承认了第四个位置，称你为黑渡鸦。
            <<else>>
              新伤口底下，有股稳定的感觉。四周安静了下来。
            <</if>>
            心口的伤痕仍在，余痛却不再随时间不断加深你的创伤。
            紧绷与疲惫会慢慢散去，别的痛苦仍然会留下伤害。
        <</language>>
      </li>
      <<if !_ascension_state.jordan_told>>
        <li><<lanSwitch 'You could ask Jordan about what happened to you, if you wish to disclose it.' '如果愿意说出这件事，可以向约旦询问自身的变化。'>></li>
      <</if>>
    </ul>
  <<elseif _ascension_state.prepared_day gte 0 and !$avery_fate>>
    <h2 class='purple'><<lanSwitch 'Your terms for the ceremony' '参与仪式的条件'>></h2>
    <ul class='journal'>
      <li>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            Avery agreed to pass your request to Harper. From the following day, if your business position still carries weight, you can raise it before entering the lift at the blood-moon gathering.
            The outcome remains uncertain.
          <<option 'CN'>>
            艾弗里答应把你的要求交给哈珀。从次日起，如果你在生意上仍有足够分量，可以在血月聚会乘电梯之前提出条件。
            最后的结果仍然无法保证。
        <</language>>
      </li>
    </ul>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Company Ascension Preparation []
<<deadwood-company-header>><<endevent>><<deadwood-ascension-header>>
<<if _ascension_state.prepared_day lt 0>><<deadwood-shareholder-return>><<exit>><</if>>
<<npc Avery>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You leave the account papers closed. "That gathering upstairs. I want to take part on my own terms."
    Avery sets down <<his>> pen. "You've already been invited."
    <br><br>
    "To bring you something. To stand where I'm told. I want a share of what you're going there for."
    Avery sits back. <<His>> fingers tap the arm of the chair.
    <br><br>
    "You think the company buys you everything?"
    <br>
    "I think it means you have to hear me out."
    <br><br>
    For a while, you hear only the noise of a printer outside.
    "Harper knows the arrangements," Avery says at last. "I'll put it to <<nnpc_him 'Harper'>>. You'll hear the answer there."
    <br><br>
    "Before it starts."
    <br>
    Avery looks at you again. "Before it starts. Give <<nnpc_him 'Harper'>> time. You aren't asking for another chair in a meeting."
    <<He>> pulls the account papers towards <<himself>>. "And whatever you ask for, it doesn't come out of my share."
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你没有翻开账目。“楼上的那场聚会。我想按自己的条件参与。”
    艾弗里放下笔。“你已经受邀了。”
    <br><br>
    “给你送东西。站在指定的位置。我想分到的，是你要去那里得到的东西。”
    艾弗里靠向椅背，手指敲着扶手。
    <br><br>
    “你觉得，一家公司就能买到一切？”
    <br>
    “我觉得，你至少得听我说完。”
    <br><br>
    一时间，只有外面打印机的响动。
    “安排的事，哈珀清楚。”艾弗里终于说。“我会告诉<<nnpc_him 'Harper'>>。到那里，你会听到答复。”
    <br><br>
    “开始之前。”
    <br>
    艾弗里又看向你。“开始之前。给<<nnpc_him 'Harper'>>一些时间。你要的，可不是会议室里多放把椅子。”
    <<He>>把账目拉回面前。“还有，无论你想要什么，都不能从我的那份里拿。”
<</language>><br><br>
<<deadwood-shareholder-return>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Company Ascension Proposal []
<<deadwood-avery-ceremony-header>><<deadwood-ascension-header>>
<<if !_ascension.canPropose>><<lanLink ['Continue with them', '继续跟着他们'] 'Skyscraper Party 12'>><</lanLink>><<exit>><</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You remain outside the lift. "What did Harper say?"
    Avery turns towards the last of the guests. They are already on their way up.
    <br><br>
    "Your request is possible," Harper says. "Possible isn't certain."
    <br>
    "Explain."
    <br><br>
    Harper keeps <<nnpc_his 'Harper'>> voice low. "You still bring the stones. You still take the fox's part. Avery still receives the mask. There is a point at which the two of you might be received together."
    <br><br>
    "Might?"
    <br>
    "The others have to agree. And even if they do, what hears us may not." <<nnpc_He 'Harper'>> glances up the lift shaft. "A second fox has a precedent. What you're asking for goes further."
    <br><br>
    Avery's gaze settles on you. "If we go up with this, Remy hears it from us. You don't turn the ceremony into an argument in front of the room."
    Harper reaches towards the lift's controls. "You'll hear the terms before it starts. You can keep the role you were given instead."
    <br><br>
    The lift returns. The doors open without a sound.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你留在电梯外。“哈珀怎么说？”
    艾弗里看向最后一批宾客。他们已经上去了。
    <br><br>
    “你的要求，有可能做到。”哈珀说。“有可能，不等于一定。”
    <br>
    “说清楚。”
    <br><br>
    哈珀压低声音。“你仍然献石，承担狐狸的部分。艾弗里仍然戴上面具。到了某个时候，可以试着让你们一起被接纳。”
    <br><br>
    “试着？”
    <br>
    “其他人得同意。即便同意了，听见我们的东西也未必答应。”<<nnpc_he 'Harper'>>往电梯井上方看了一眼。“第二只狐狸有先例。你的要求，还要再往前一步。”
    <br><br>
    艾弗里的视线落在你身上。“要带着这个要求上楼，就由我们告诉雷米。别当着所有人的面，把仪式变成吵架。”
    哈珀伸手靠近电梯按钮。“开始前，你会听到条件。也可以照原来给你的角色参与。”
    <br><br>
    电梯回来了，门悄无声息地打开。
<</language>><br><br>
<<socialiseicon 'agree'>><<lanLink ['Take your request upstairs', '带着要求上楼'] 'Skyscraper Party 12'>>
  <<run maplebirch.get('Finance').company.ascension.propose()>>
<</lanLink>><br>
<<refuseicon>><<lanLink ['Keep the original arrangement', '按原来的安排参与'] 'Skyscraper Party 12'>>
  <<run maplebirch.get('Finance').company.ascension.withdraw()>>
<</lanLink>><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Leave before the lift goes up', '在电梯上去之前离开'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Company Avery Ceremony Leave'>>
  <<run maplebirch.get('Finance').company.ascension.withdraw()>><<set $Finance.company.avery.decision to 'leave'>><<npcincr Avery rage 3>>
<</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Company Ascension Audience []
<<deadwood-company-header>><<endevent>><<deadwood-ascension-header>>
<<if !_ascension.active or !_ascension_state.recognized>><<deadwood-ascension-return>><<exit>><</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    The clerk looks up your name in the appointments book and shows you to the reception room. Nobody mentions a Black Raven.
    Calls to Harper or Remy can be put through from here. Avery can speak in person, when available.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    职员在会面登记簿上找到你的名字，把你领到接待室。没人提起“黑渡鸦”。
    哈珀与雷米可以从这里打电话联系。若艾弗里有空，也能当面交谈。
<</language>><br><br>
<<if _ascension.canAudience>>
  <<if C.npc.Avery.state is 'active' and !$avery_injury and $avery_mansion.schedule isnot 'away'>>
    <<socialiseicon 'chat'>><<lanLink ['Ask Avery about sharing power (0:15)', '问艾弗里如何分享权力 (0:15)'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Company Ascension Audience Result'>>
      <<if maplebirch.get('Finance').company.ascension.audience('avery')>><<pass 15>><</if>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if C.npc.Harper.state is 'active'>>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink ['Call Harper about the change (0:15)', '打电话向哈珀询问变化 (0:15)'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Company Ascension Audience Result'>>
      <<if maplebirch.get('Finance').company.ascension.audience('harper')>><<pass 15>><</if>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if C.npc.Remy.state is 'active'>>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink ['Call Remy about your place (0:15)', '打电话向雷米询问你的位置 (0:15)'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Company Ascension Audience Result'>>
      <<if maplebirch.get('Finance').company.ascension.audience('remy')>><<pass 15>><</if>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      No further conversation can be arranged today.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      今天没能再安排谈话。
  <</language>><br><br>
<</if>>
<<deadwood-ascension-return>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Company Ascension Audience Result []
<<deadwood-company-header>><<endevent>><<deadwood-ascension-header>>
<<if !_ascension.active or !_ascension_state.recognized or _ascension_state.audience_day isnot Math.floor(Time.days)>><<deadwood-ascension-return>><<exit>><</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<switch _ascension_state.audience>>
      <<case 'avery'>>
        Avery puts a finger between the pages of a report. "You wanted to talk about what happened upstairs?"
        <br><br>
        <<if $speech_attitude is 'meek' or $speech_attitude_avery>>
          "If you have time. I'd like to know what happens now."
        <<elseif $speech_attitude is 'bratty'>>
          "I have a place up there now. What are you going to do with that?"
        <<else>>
          "About what comes next."
        <</if>>
        <br>
        <<if $averyragerevealed is 1 and C.npc.Avery.rage gte 20>>
          "You don't start giving me orders because Remy gave you a name." Avery's finger presses into the report.
          <br><br>
          "We agreed on a place," you say.
          <br>
          "A place. Not my company. Not my house." <<nnpc_He 'Avery'>> shuts the report. "Put what you want in writing. I'll read it."
          <br><br>
          The chair remains beside the desk. Avery waits for you to speak, jaw tight.
        <<elseif $Finance.company.avery.business_only>>
          "For the company? More work." Avery turns the report so you can read it.
          <br><br>
          You ask whether the new name changes your agreement.
          "You wanted business. That's what you're getting. If you want something changed, give me a proposal."
        <<elseif C.npc.Avery.love lt 20>>
          "Your name doesn't sign contracts." Avery opens the report at a page of figures.
          <br><br>
          You ask whether the new place gives you more say.
          "Upstairs, you'll be heard. Down here, show me what it earns us."
        <<else>>
          "For the company? More work. For us?" <<nnpc_He 'Avery'>> looks at you. "That depends what you want."
          <br><br>
          You ask whether the new name changes how <<nnpc_he 'Avery'>> sees you.
          "I was looking at you before Remy put a name to it. Don't flatter yourself that <<nnpc_he 'Remy'>> noticed first."
          <br><br>
          <<if C.npc.Avery.lust gte 60>>
            <<nnpc_His 'Avery'>> gaze drops to your lips, then lower. "The name isn't what I notice when you're sitting this close."
            You glance at the report. Avery follows your gaze and opens it again.
          <<elseif C.npc.Avery.love gte 60 and $dateCount.Avery gt 0>>
            <<nnpc_He 'Avery'>> shifts the report aside. "We'll still have our evenings. I'd rather hear about your plans over dinner."
            For a moment, <<nnpc_his 'Avery'>> attention stays on you instead of the open pages.
          <<elseif $dateCount.Avery gt 0>>
            <<nnpc_He 'Avery'>> holds your gaze. "We'll still have our evenings. Unless you've decided you're too grand for those now."
          <<else>>
            <<nnpc_He 'Avery'>> smiles. "Perhaps you'll stop making every invitation sound like a summons from the board."
          <</if>>
          <br><br>
          Avery turns back to the report, keeping your chair beside the desk. "The next meeting still needs you prepared."
        <</if>>
      <<case 'harper'>>
        The clerk closes the reception-room door after connecting your call.
        "Any change in sleep? Appetite?" Harper asks before you've finished saying hello.
        <br><br>
        You tell <<nnpc_him 'Harper'>> about the wound. It still aches, but the ache no longer leaves you caught in what happened.
        "And your other symptoms?"
        <br>
        "I feel less wound up. Less tired, given time."
        <br><br>
        You hear a pen scrape across paper. "How long does it take? Has it changed anything else?"
        <<nnpc_He 'Harper'>> lets you finish, then asks the same questions in a different order.
        <br><br>
        "You should come in if the symptoms change," Harper says. "And don't invite it to look again just to see whether it will."
        The pen stops. "We have enough to observe for now."
      <<case 'remy'>>
        Someone answers the number on the clerk's card, then puts the phone down. After a wait, Remy picks it up.
        "The Raven. What is it?"
        <br><br>
        You ask what the new place lets you do.
        "Keep your business running. Make yourself useful. If something needs moving, I want to know you can move it."
        <br>
        "And when we disagree?"
        <br><br>
        "Then we disagree." Remy's voice hardens. "You aren't getting my land. Or my people. You want something from me, bring something I want."
        <br><br>
        A voice calls from the other end. Remy covers the receiver, speaks, then comes back.
        "Avery built upwards. You'd better find room to grow without standing on my feet."
        The line clicks off.
    <</switch>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<switch _ascension_state.audience>>
      <<case 'avery'>>
        艾弗里用手指夹住报告的书页。“要谈那晚的事？”
        <br><br>
        <<if $speech_attitude is 'meek' or $speech_attitude_avery>>
          “如果你有空。我想知道，接下来会怎么样。”
        <<elseif $speech_attitude is 'bratty'>>
          “我现在也有楼上的席位了。你打算怎么对待这件事？”
        <<else>>
          “谈接下来怎么办。”
        <</if>>
        <br>
        <<if $averyragerevealed is 1 and C.npc.Avery.rage gte 20>>
          “别因为雷米给你取了个名字，就开始命令我。”艾弗里的手指压进书页。
          <br><br>
          “我们说好了，给我一个席位。”你说。
          <br>
          “席位。不是我的公司，更不是我的家。”<<nnpc_he 'Avery'>>合上报告。“把要求写下来。我会看。”
          <br><br>
          椅子仍在桌旁。艾弗里紧绷着下颌，等你开口。
        <<elseif $Finance.company.avery.business_only>>
          “公司的事？继续干活。”艾弗里转过报告，让你能看清。
          <br><br>
          你问，新名字是否改变了你们的约定。
          “你要谈生意，那就谈生意。想改什么，给我一份提案。”
        <<elseif C.npc.Avery.love lt 20>>
          “你的名字不能签合同。”艾弗里把报告翻到一页数字。
          <br><br>
          你问，新的席位是否让你更有发言权。
          “在楼上，会有人听你说话。在这里，让我看看你能赚来什么。”
        <<else>>
          “公司的事？继续干活。我们的事？”<<nnpc_he 'Avery'>>看向你。“看你想要什么。”
          <br><br>
          你问，那个新名字是否改变了<<nnpc_he 'Avery'>>对你的看法。
          “雷米给你取名字以前，我就已经在看你了。别自作多情，觉得是<<nnpc_he 'Remy'>>先注意到你。”
          <br><br>
          <<if C.npc.Avery.lust gte 60>>
            <<nnpc_he 'Avery'>>的视线落到你的嘴唇，又往下移。“你坐得这么近，我注意的可不是名字。”
            你看向报告。艾弗里顺着你的目光，把它重新翻开。
          <<elseif C.npc.Avery.love gte 60 and $dateCount.Avery gt 0>>
            <<nnpc_he 'Avery'>>把报告移到一旁。“我们的约会还是会有。我更想在晚餐时，听听你的计划。”
            有一会儿，<<nnpc_he 'Avery'>>只顾看你，没再翻动书页。
          <<elseif $dateCount.Avery gt 0>>
            <<nnpc_he 'Avery'>>迎着你的目光。“我们的约会还是会有。除非你现在觉得，自己的身份不适合那些了。”
          <<else>>
            <<nnpc_he 'Avery'>>笑了笑。“也许以后，你不会把每次邀约都当作董事会传唤。”
          <</if>>
          <br><br>
          艾弗里重新翻开报告，仍把你的椅子留在桌旁。“下次会议，记得做足准备。”
        <</if>>
      <<case 'harper'>>
        接通电话后，职员替你关上接待室的门。
        “睡眠有变化吗？食欲呢？”你还没问完好，哈珀便开始发问。
        <br><br>
        你说起那道伤口。它仍然疼，却不再让你陷在那晚的事里。
        “其他症状呢？”
        <br>
        “没那么紧绷了。过一阵子，疲惫也会缓下来。”
        <br><br>
        电话里传来笔尖擦过纸面的声音。“多久？还有什么别的变化吗？”
        <<nnpc_he 'Harper'>>让你说完，又换个顺序，把刚才的问题问了一遍。
        <br><br>
        “如果症状有变化，就来找我。”哈珀说。“还有，别为了试试它会不会回应，就再请它看过来。”
        笔声停了。“眼下，已经有足够的东西可以观察。”
      <<case 'remy'>>
        职员给的号码有人接了，对方随即把电话放下。等了一会，雷米才拿起听筒。
        “渡鸦。什么事？”
        <br><br>
        你问，有了这个位置，你能做些什么。
        “经营好你的生意。做点有用的事。需要运东西时，我得知道你能运得动。”
        <br>
        “要是我们意见不合呢？”
        <br><br>
        “那就不合。”雷米的声音冷了下来。“我的地不会给你，我的人也不会。想从我这里拿东西，就带点我想要的来。”
        <br><br>
        电话另一头有人喊话。雷米捂住听筒，说了几句，才回来。
        “艾弗里往天上盖。你最好也找点地方发展，别踩在我的脚上。”
        电话挂断了。
    <</switch>>
<</language>><br><br>
<<deadwood-ascension-return>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Company Ascension Jordan []
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<deadwood-ascension-header>>
<<if !_ascension_state.ascended or !_ascension_state.jordan_told>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Step away', '走开'] 'Temple'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<npc Jordan>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Jordan listens while you describe the tower, the red light, and the wound that nobody can see.
    You keep a hand above your heart as you explain how it feels different now.
    <br><br>
    "It helps me," you say.
    <br>
    Jordan looks at your hand. "How do you feel now?"
    <br><br>
    You explain how the ache no longer wears at your thoughts, and how your burdens gradually ease. <<He>> does not interrupt.
    When you finish, <<he>> rests a hand on your shoulder.
    <br><br>
    "You can come here when you're afraid," <<he>> says. "Even if you feel better than you did."
    <br>
    "Can you take it away?"
    <br><br>
    Jordan pauses. "I won't promise what I don't know. I'll pray with you, if you wish."
    <<His>> hand stays on your shoulder a little longer. "And if there's pain in your chest, please let a doctor see you."
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你讲起塔楼、红光，以及那道谁也看不见的伤口。约旦一直听着。
    说起如今不同的感觉时，你把手按在心口上方。
    <br><br>
    “它能帮我。”你说。
    <br>
    约旦看着你的手。“你现在是什么感觉？”
    <br><br>
    你解释，余痛不再一点点磨损你的思绪，身上的负担也会慢慢缓下来。<<He>>没有打断。
    等你说完，<<he>>把手放在你的肩上。
    <br><br>
    “害怕时，你可以来这里。”<<he>>说。“即使已经比以前好一些。”
    <br>
    “你能把它拿走吗？”
    <br><br>
    约旦停了一下。“我不能为自己不清楚的事作保证。如果你愿意，我可以陪你祈祷。”
    <<His>>的手在你的肩上多留了一会。“还有，如果胸口疼，请让医生看看。”
<</language>><br><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Step away', '走开'] 'Temple'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>
